WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.587
Unpivoting converts repeated measure columns into rows.

00:00:03.587 --> 00:00:07.732
The wide source has one product row with several month columns.

00:00:07.732 --> 00:00:11.462
The long result will have a month column and a revenue column.

00:00:11.462 --> 00:00:15.597
The row grain changes from one product to one product-month.

00:00:15.597 --> 00:00:22.857
A pivot converts category values into columns, usually through conditional aggregation in portable SQL.

00:00:22.857 --> 00:00:26.412
Each target column needs a clear aggregation rule.

00:00:26.412 --> 00:00:32.232
Before pivoting, check whether the source contains more than one value for the same row-key and category

00:00:32.232 --> 00:00:33.013
combination.
